      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISTRESS GRACE (2) was in the minors two back (23.41) at this track but ran below best last time at Sale, finishing 8th. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from three starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. ORANGE TWIST (1) comes off an average effort last start when fifth at Healesville over 350m behind Not Perfect (19.91) in a Mix 6/7 H. Was a winner prior to that. Shapes as one to consider. LAKEVIEW CHASER (4) turned spotting a big start finishing seventh (26.71) last time in a Mix 6/7 FIN at this track. His last run is a proven strong form reference. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. BELMONDO BLUE (6) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
